    {
      "bbox": [
        198,
        757,
        1508,
        833
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, LGBTQIA+ people across the United States are facing an increasingly hostile political environment; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.2022,
          "min": -1.0324
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 20,
          "mean": -0.0005,
          "min": -0.0086
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 7543,
        "area_px": 99484,
        "density": 0.07582,
        "chars": 111,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 14.72
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        198,
        872,
        1508,
        989
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, LGBTQIA+ New Yorkers represent at least 15 percent of the City's population, comprising a community that intersects and enriches the entire City, yet they have unique needs that have been historically underfunded and left unaddressed; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.1713,
          "min": -0.8861
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 52,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0004
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 15809,
        "area_px": 151164,
        "density": 0.10458,
        "chars": 247,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 15.62
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        198,
        1026,
        1508,
        1144
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, the cost-of-living crisis confronting the City's working class hits the LGBTQIA+ community particularly hard, with higher rates of unemployment and homelessness than the City population at large; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.1498,
          "min": -1.0733
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 39,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0003
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 13808,
        "area_px": 152456,
        "density": 0.09057,
        "chars": 208,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 15.06
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        198,
        1181,
        1508,
        1260
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, this Administration believes that LGBTQIA+ New Yorkers should be represented in all aspects of our City; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.139,
          "min": -1.1049
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 23,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0017
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 7933,
        "area_px": 103360,
        "density": 0.07675,
        "chars": 117,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 14.75
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        198,
        1298,
        1508,
        1412
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, the NYC Unity Project was launched in September 2017 as New York City's first Citywide initiative focused on delivering and coordinating affirming services for LGBTQIA+ New Yorkers; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.1494,
          "min": -1.1116
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 41,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0007
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 13095,
        "area_px": 148580,
        "density": 0.08813,
        "chars": 194,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 14.81
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        194,
        1451,
        1508,
        1569
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, this Administration is committed to identifying and addressing the needs of the LGBTQIA+ community and to providing a single destination for LGBTQIA+ New Yorkers to turn to for matters affecting their communities;",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.1619,
          "min": -0.9275
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 40,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.005
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 15224,
        "area_px": 152456,
        "density": 0.09986,
        "chars": 222,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 14.58
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        198,
        1607,
        1505,
        1683
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "NOW, THEREFORE, by the power vested in me as Mayor of the City of New York, it is hereby ordered:",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.1675,
          "min": -1.5844
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 25,
          "mean": -0.0002,
          "min": -0.0036
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 6800,
        "area_px": 98192,
        "density": 0.06925,
        "chars": 97,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 14.26
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        190,
        1722,
        1505,
        1955
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 1. There is hereby established an Office of LGBTQIA+ Affairs within the Office of the Mayor. The Office of LGBTQIA+ Affairs (\"the Office\") shall operate within and report to the Mayor's Office of Equity & Racial Justice which shall be supervised and coordinated by the Deputy Mayor for Economic Justice. The Office shall be headed by a Director appointed by the Mayor and shall replace the NYC Unity Project, whose former responsibilities will be carried out pursuant to this Order.",
      "logprob_stats": {
